WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Walk the line first. Set four cones on flat ground with room to move.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Shuffle with control. Stay low. Use small side steps without crossing feet.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Stay balanced. Pause at the end. Return, then rest between rounds.

